+@ pkbn POC-14: NET CHALLENGE - custom battles that pay NaviCust programs (src/pkbn/challenge.c)
+EventScript_PkbnNetChallenge::
+	playse SE_PC_LOGIN
+	msgbox Text_PkbnNetChallengeLogin, MSGBOX_DEFAULT
